      "title": "Improper Input Validation in io.netty:netty-handler",
      "description": "Affected versions of io.netty:netty-handler are vulnerable to Improper Input Validation. A crafted packet sent to the SslHandler in Netty may not be validated correctly, leading to a potential native crash. If an attacker exploits this vulnerability by sending specially crafted SSL packets, it risks destabilizing the application, particularly in high-performance protocol servers relying on Netty",
